Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Rasetsu Academy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For Shiki and the others' new training, \NMudano called in Nekozaki and Innami to act as disruptors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(184.8,108.8)\frz21.2}Meeting over in 5 minutes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(195.2,116.267)}Oni momomomo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\pos(189.6,262.4)}EP25
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Each individual's abilities are summarized in the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mudano-senpai! In order to guide the students on a better path, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,please tell us about their traits and personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank yo—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Innami! \N\We gotta extract their info and have plenty of fun with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only explaining this once, so listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiki Ichinose. \NHis main characteristic... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,being an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't he the Kishin's child?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a brainless fool who charges in no matter how dangerous the place or how strong the opponent is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He really is an idiot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikari Yaoroshi. \NIdiot #2.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He easily falls for provocations and lacks cooperativeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So he's the one to tease, huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin Kougasaki. Idiot #3. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He avoids bonding with allies and \Nisn't utilizing his judgment or analytical skills. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there are signs of change recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Test him in various ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, the ''smart guy'' type of idiot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, Homare Byobugaura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She has almost no control over her blood and \Ncompletely lacks self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A timid, small-animal type?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rokuro Kiriyama. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He always seems to be in poor health, \Nbut you can ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you sure?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuina Sazanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Trait: It's difficult to separate her from Rokuro. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to isolate them, \Ntargeting someone else is more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are they dating or something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Juji Yusurube. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quick-witted, but because his ability is search-oriented, \Nhe has a strong aversion to combat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving him alone with a girl is strictly forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! \NThey are such unique students.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The issues and weaknesses \Nthey hold are the seeds for them to grow stronger. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do my absolute best to nurture those seeds and make them bloom into full pow-!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're a bunch of idiots full of problems \Nand selfish to the extreme. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,However, they have experienced real combat in Kyoto and Nerima. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They fought against Momotaro's combat units and returned alive. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
